<NgraceChangePlan graceVersion="1.0" status="draft">
  <C-CRITERION-CLOSE-EVIDENCE>
    <IntentSummary>
      Add a close-bound AC-* state
      as a CloseEvidence child that
      holds at least one non-empty
      Command. Forgotten AC-* still
      warn unmapped. Both-states
      Satisfies is an error. plan new
      does not Satisfies-link
      close-bound ids. gate verdict
      on an applied archived bundle
      runs each Command, records one
      AC-* child per result, and
      refuses outcome pass on a
      non-zero exit. review on that
      same applied archive finds a
      missing record; it does not
      refuse the close. Post-archive
      lint 0/0 is close-verdict
      evidence, not an AC-* on this
      bundle. README.md is the
      skillTextLines measurement
      cell only. examples/ unchanged.
    </IntentSummary>
